msgctxt "92"
msgid "Stardust on Tenkaichi Street is the top host club in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"The cops are cracking down on clubs bringing in customers off the street. "
"Lots of places are having trouble staying outta the red, but Stardust is as "
"popular as ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr "Perché?"

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"They've got a reputation for not overcharging... Just letting their "
"customers have fun, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Really, I think you can chalk it up to Kazuki and Yuya, the owner and the "
"manager. They run an honest business. Even their hosts trust them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"But there's been a lot of trouble at Stardust, lately. They don't pay "
"protection money, so they get harassed by the local yakuza pretty often."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Still, I guess that's part of what makes the place so appealing⑬they don't "
"make deals with those brutes."
msgstr ""

